  <!--EN: A sturdy metal container designed for incinerating wastepacks. As it burns, it emits pollution and releases toxic gases, contaminating the surrounding area and creating an unfavorable environment for those sensitive to pollution, while proving advantageous for carriers of pollution-adaptive genes.-->
  <VRE_BurnBarrel.description>一种坚固的金属容器，专为焚烧废物包而设计。当它燃烧时，它会排放污染物并释放有毒气体，污染周围地区，为那些对污染敏感的人创造不利的环境，同时对污染适应基因的携带者来说是有利的。</VRE_BurnBarrel.description>
  <!--EN: burn barrel-->
  <VRE_BurnBarrel.label>烧桶</VRE_BurnBarrel.label>
